Each commodity in an implicit posting is checked.

========== API ==========

accounts({})

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Holdings
account Bank
account Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 100 USD
commodity OTHER
  format 1,000 OTHER
2024-01-01 Multiple commodities
  Holdings  2 FUND
  Holdings  3 OTHER
  Opening

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Positive FUND posting must use a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}); the default commodity is USD
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:13:3

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Positive OTHER posting must use a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}); the default commodity is USD
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:14:3

[NEGATIVE_POSTING_DATE_HOLDING] Opening: holding is -2 FUND on 2024-01-01 using posting dates; disposals must not precede available acquisitions
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:15:3

[NEGATIVE_POSTING_DATE_HOLDING] Opening: holding is -3 OTHER on 2024-01-01 using posting dates; disposals must not precede available acquisitions
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:15:3
